      "id": "creation_of_enkidu",
      "directed": false,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "moulded_on_desert_as_warrior",
        "label": "So when the goddess Aruru heard this, in her mind she imagined (Straightway, this) Concept of Anu, and, washing her hands, (then) Aruru Finger\u2019d some clay, on the desert she moulded (it): (thus) on the desert Enkidu made she, a warrior",
        "instagraph:color": "#DCC8F8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "seduction_of_enkidu",
      "directed": false,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "tamed_wild_man_via_hetaera",
        "label": "Six days, (aye) seven nights, with the courtesan-girl in his mating. Sated at length with her charms, he turn d his face to his cattle, O the gazelles, (how) they scamper\u2019d away, as soon as they saw him!",
        "instagraph:color": "#DCC8F8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fight_at_erech",
      "directed": false,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "grappled_and_snorted_like_bulls_in_highway",
        "label": "Enkidu barr d up the door with his foot, (and) to Gilgamish entry\u2014 Would not concede: they grappled and snorted(?) like bulls, (and) the threshold Shatter\u2019d: the (very) wall quiver\u2019d as Gilgamish!, Enkidu grappled",
        "instagraph:color": "#DCC8F8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slaying_of_humbaba",
      "directed": false,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "o'erthrew_humbaba_and_beheaded",
        "label": "Wherefore against Humbaba he raised mighty winds: (yea), a great wind... Seizing \"Humbaba\u2019 before and behind, so that nor to go forwards, Nor to go back was he able: and then Humbaba surrender\u2019d. ... they cut off the head of Humbaba.",
        "instagraph:color": "#DCC8F8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ishtar_rebuff",
      "directed": false,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "scorned_divine_marriage_proposal",
        "label": "Lady Ishtar espieth the beauty of Gilgamish: (saith she), \u201cGilgamish, come, be a bridegroom... What, then, will be my advantage, supposing\u2019 I take thee in marriage? Thou 'rt but a back door \"not\" giving resistance to blast or to windstorm, Thou 'rt but a palace which dasheth the heroes \"within it to pieces\u2019",
        "instagraph:color": "#DCC8F8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "slaying_of_divine_bull",
      "directed": false,
      "attrs": {
        "i2t:predicate": "slew_heavenly_bull_and_defied_ishtar",
        "label": "(So), what time they the Bull of the Heavens had kili\u2019d, its heart they - removed, Unto the Sun-god they offer'd in sacrifice... Woe unto Gilgamish\u2014he who by killing the Bull of the Heavens, Made me lament. ... Wrenching the member from out of the Bull, he toss\u2019d (it) before her",
        "instagraph:color": "#DCC8F8"
      }
    },
    {
